{
  "longTitle": "To make provision about eligibility for a child trust fund; to repeal the Saving Gateway Accounts Act 2009; to make provision about entitlement to health in pregnancy grant; and for connected purposes.",
  "summary": "<p>This Bill gives effect to decisions made as part of the initial review of public expenditure undertaken soon after the 2010 General Election. </p><p>Three schemes introduced by the previous Labour Government &ndash; the Child Trust Fund; the Saving Gateway; and the Health in Pregnancy Grant &ndash; are deemed to be unaffordable by the Coalition Government and will be brought to a close by the provisions of the Bill.</p>",
